          <Pad Id="NzvUMVcRzNye1HYxZqQneE" Bounds="940,190,320,62" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Two squares, each with a Name attribute. The label is whatever the attribute holds - change a Value and the map rewrites it.">
